The word bigram and trigram lists built or improved from Tatoeba
(data/*/*_bigrams.txt.gz, data/*/*_trigrams.txt.gz, generated by
scripts/import_tatoeba_ngrams.py) and the word lists counted from it
(the languages data/README.md lists under "Tatoeba Word Lists", generated by
scripts/import_tatoeba_words.py) are derived works of:

  Tatoeba sentence corpus, https://tatoeba.org/
  Licensed under Creative Commons Attribution 2.0 France (CC BY 2.0 FR)
  and CC0; contributed by the Tatoeba community.


The word lists built by scripts/import_corpus_words.py (the languages
data/README.md lists under "eBible and Glot500 Word Lists") count the words of:

  eBible corpus, https://github.com/BibleNLP/ebible
  Redistributable Bible translations, each under the licence recorded for
  it in metadata/translations.csv.

  Glot500-c, https://huggingface.co/datasets/cis-lmu/Glot500
  A collection of openly licensed text; see the dataset card for each source.

The Uzbek (Latin) word list and word bigram and trigram lists
(data/uz/uz_full.txt.gz, data/uz/uz_bigrams.txt.gz,
data/uz/uz_trigrams.txt.gz) count the words of:

  UzCrawl, https://huggingface.co/datasets/tahrirchi/uz-crawl
  (revision 8fff2d17bb2607c5d875199c8a7256a4a7ce7e39), by Mukhammadsaid
  Mamasaidov and Abror Shopulatov (Tahrirchi).
  Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0; see
  data/LICENSE-AOSP-APACHE-2.0.txt for the licence text.

  UzBooks V2, https://huggingface.co/datasets/tahrirchi/uz-books-v2
  (revision aac9c105622abf1b554640793d1fe17ab2ff28d9), by Mukhammadsaid
  Mamasaidov and Abror Shopulatov (Tahrirchi).
  Licensed under the MIT License; see data/LICENSE-UZBOOKS-MIT.txt.

Only word and word-sequence counts are redistributed.

